## Headings & prose

### H3 inside H2

#### H4 inside H3

Paragraph after a heading should sit closer to its heading than to the previous block. Notion-style stacked-heading collapse is handled by `.mk-doc h1 + h2` rules.

A long paragraph to test line-height and wrapping: Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat.

Another paragraph immediately after, no heading between — this is the gap your `--mk-p-mt` / `--mk-p-mb` controls.

