## Inline formatting

Plain text with **bold**, *italic*, ***bold-italic***, ~~strikethrough~~, `inline code`, and a [link to example.com](https://example.com).

You can mix: a sentence with **bold containing `inline code`** and *italics containing [a link](https://example.com)* — useful for spotting baseline drift.

