## Code

Inline: `const x = 42;` or a path like `packages/shared/editor/src/rich-text-editor.tsx`.

Fenced, no language:

```
plain preformatted block
preserves    whitespace
```

TypeScript:

```ts
type Mode = 'compact' | 'default' | 'cozy'

function paragraphMargin(mode: Mode): string {
  switch (mode) {
    case 'compact': return '0.7em'
    case 'default': return '1.25em'
    case 'cozy':    return '1.75em'
  }
}
```

Bash:

```bash
pnpm dev
pnpm typecheck
pnpm test:e2e
```

JSON:

```json
{
  "readability": "default",
  "tokens": {
    "p-mt": "1.25em",
    "p-mb": "1.25em"
  }
}
```

